# Share links when the server limits sharing (specs/004-share-links US6). Run after 18-share-links.walk with the same server: the server now forces a password,
# forces an expiry date of at most 7 days and does not allow upload through public links. The create form says so before anything is entered, a tap on Create
# with nothing entered is refused with the reason and marked fields, and nothing is created.
# server share-rules password on
# server share-rules expiry 7
# server share-rules upload off
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeFiles
waitfor folderRow
tap folderUp
wait 400
tap folderUp
wait 400
waitfor folderRow
tap folderSelect
wait 300
tap folderRow 1
wait 300
tap folderShare
waitfor shareRow
tap shareCreate
waitfor shareFormCreate
shot @OUT@/195-share-form-rules.png
expect shareFormPassword Required
expect shareFormExpiry Required
expect shareFormLimit At most 7 days
expect shareFormPermissionRow Not allowed
tap shareFormCreate
wait 500
shot @OUT@/196-share-form-refused.png
expect shareFormMessage password
expect shareFormMessage At most 7 days
expect_absent dialogText
# the password alone is not enough: the date is required as well, and a date beyond the maximum is refused with the limit stated
tap shareFormPassword
wait 400
type Zx9-secret-pw
key Return
wait 400
tap shareFormExpiry
wait 400
type 2099-01-01
key Return
wait 400
tap shareFormCreate
wait 500
expect shareFormMessage too far
expect shareFormMessage At most 7 days
shot @OUT@/197-share-form-too-far.png
tap shareFormBack
wait 400
tap shareBack
wait 400
tap folderSelectDone
wait 300
